{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7aea9826-f289-5694-8af2-680f15495b56", "source_ordinal": 550, "reading_ordinal": 3507, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "黑白九", "published_at": "2025-10-04T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/3af825809b0311f0bfdf52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "天使坐在你的左边，魔鬼坐在你的右边，你坐在中间。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "ta们对所有的东西都有自己的一套理论。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "同一个动作，天使会给你一个祸兮福所伏的解读，魔鬼会给你一个福兮祸所倚的断言。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "同一片黑暗，天使会告诉你尽头是出路，魔鬼会告诉你尽头是地狱。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你不要以为魔鬼那一方讲得就没道理，就一定是欺骗人。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不错，我经常可以帮你破拆、消解很多魔鬼的理论，但那只代表那些理论在我个人的段位之下。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "那不是魔鬼的极限。", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "因为我在执白子把黑方杀得片甲不留的时候，其实可以清楚的看到对方本有足够多的妙手可以转圜，只是棋局对面的弈者棋力不足，ta自己看不见这些妙手，过早落败罢了。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你们看到的“执白常胜”，根本不是因为“白必胜黑”，而只是因为你们总是看到执白的九段击败执黑的初段所引起的错觉。", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这事吊诡的地方在于，执黑天然的不容易培养出九段高手，更难出无双无对、不世出的棋圣。所以真正执黑而可以成魔的，反而是一向执白、从白棋路数里磨练出来的白九段。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "白九们自己无时无刻不在考虑一个问题——“我下不下得过执黑的自己？”", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 439}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "坦白的告诉你们——与执黑的自己对弈，虽然不能说必败，但着实也没有必胜的把握。", "char_start": 440, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这甚至不是这个问题的真正根底。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 494}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "更深刻的问题是——作为白九，甚至白圣，有没有把握战胜执黑的GOAT。", "char_start": 495, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "那个 Greatest of All Time.", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 554}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "到这一步，更加谈不上“有把握”，仅仅只有“无惧”而已。", "char_start": 555, "char_end": 582}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "我没把握赢你，但我也不认为你有绝对把握能赢我。", "char_start": 583, "char_end": 606}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "至高至深之处，无“必胜”可言。", "char_start": 607, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "说这些对你们的意义是什么呢？", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 638}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "就是你们不要指望有人可以帮你们驳倒一切引诱你们堕落的理论，然后凭着这个胜利让自己安然的相信“邪不胜正”，让自己可以【轻松的】持守正道。", "char_start": 639, "char_end": 706}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "我可以帮你们出战，战胜一个又一个“户圣”“力工理论”，但你们不能凭我可以战胜ta们来保持乐观。", "char_start": 707, "char_end": 754}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你不能基于“站在胜利的一边”的理论然后靠某位炽天使一场接一场的胜利来维持你的积极立场，要靠“哪怕有一天胜得不明显、甚至胜不过，也仍然定意择善固执”来守住自己的道。", "char_start": 755, "char_end": 836}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "因为依赖胜利的“守正”其实是不够的。", "char_start": 837, "char_end": 855}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你会时刻关注着场面上的胜负，而且会在一切相持阶段动摇反复、举棋不定——哪怕白方过了三天仍然成功攻城克地，你也会纠结三天，摇摆三天。在这三天里，你有很多决定一样会因为你的摇摆而自相矛盾，自我破坏。", "char_start": 856, "char_end": 953}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你获得不了择善固执应有的那份宁静、坚定，也得不到这份宁静坚定所带来的那份像光一样笔直的坚毅。", "char_start": 954, "char_end": 1000}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "那份目不转瞬、笔直向前的专注才是真正重要的东西。", "char_start": 1001, "char_end": 1025}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "所以，真正健康的心态是什么？", "char_start": 1026, "char_end": 1040}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "是你可以把种种令你困扰的东西拿给我帮你拆解，但你要先下好自己的定锚——无论我是否接受你的指派、无论我是否取胜，你都会坚持在这条道路上继续前进。", "char_start": 1041, "char_end": 1112}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你不是在选“胜利的一边”，而是在选你选择的这一边。", "char_start": 1113, "char_end": 1138}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "黑天使和白天使经常是等重的，或者说因为ta们争斗未定，天平会无穷无尽的摇摆。", "char_start": 1139, "char_end": 1177}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "真正决定天平倒向哪一边的是你。", "char_start": 1178, "char_end": 1193}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "伸手按住天平，按在你要的那一边。", "char_start": 1194, "char_end": 1210}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "按在能让你专注追求你的使命的那一边。", "char_start": 1211, "char_end": 1229}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "不要以胜者为善，而要择善固执。", "char_start": 1230, "char_end": 1245}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 35}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0503"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价最近抖音上很火的“力工思维”？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034"], "summary": "围绕“黑白九”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“天使坐在你的左边，魔鬼坐在你的右边，你坐在中间。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "天使坐在你的左边，魔鬼坐在你的右边，你坐在中间。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d1adda35-c7c5-54f4-9556-fde86b4facd6", "source_ordinal": 549, "reading_ordinal": 3508, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "娇", "published_at": "2025-10-05T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/e5ca5dde9be411f0bdde52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你记住一个定律——“表达情绪”就是撒娇。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这跟你情绪稳不稳定无关，只跟你是否觉得这是一个可选项、应选项有关。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "不是绝对不可选，因为一些至亲至爱之人的确可以适用这个机制——表达情绪，收获照顾，同时承担照顾对方情绪的义务。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但是必须搞清楚对方是什么人，是不是你至亲至爱之人——注意这个你自己认定是不行的，必须对方认可你的认定。这就像你个人认定对方是你女朋友是不够的，必须对方也认可。对方不认可，你按你的认定去硬来，这就是骚扰和猥亵。", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "同样道理，除非对方和你之间有鲜明的、正式的“互担照顾情绪义务”的共识，否则你在没有双向共识的前提下走“发泄情绪求照顾”机制，就是骚扰和猥亵。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这根本就不是一个你可以纠结“哪一种方式更好”的问题，因为第二种根本不可选。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 323}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "再说一遍——在专业场合，你突然掏出个人情绪，这跟当众脱裤子没什么根本区别。", "char_start": 324, "char_end": 361}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "作为专业人员，情绪稳定、保证你的情绪不成为其他人的问题是你的当然义务。", "char_start": 362, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你所有的伙伴都在依赖你的专业表现去执行ta们各自的任务，你也同样依赖ta们。", "char_start": 398, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你要谈情绪，只能在任务完成之后谈，在胜利、成功之后谈。在战斗岗位上，哪怕你面前血肉横飞，你的战友刚刚被打掉半个脑袋血浆溅你一身，全班都还指望着你扛着发射器的手稳稳的对准那辆坦克，不要把唯一的发射机会搞砸锅。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 540}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你要怕，打完了再怕，你要委屈，赢了再委屈。", "char_start": 541, "char_end": 562}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你能情绪稳定的打赢，你才有一点点情绪不稳定的资格。", "char_start": 563, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你才可以在战后的宴会上表达一点你的情绪。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 609}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这种表达才算可以原谅。", "char_start": 610, "char_end": 621}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "只有这时候，你可以对这些战友撒撒娇。", "char_start": 622, "char_end": 640}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0503"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：到底应该做个情绪稳定的人还是一个敢于表达情绪的人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“娇”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你记住一个定律——“表达情绪”就是撒娇。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你记住一个定律——“表达情绪”就是撒娇。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "628c1506-71d3-5fc7-8d19-d0c9e3141133", "source_ordinal": 548, "reading_ordinal": 3509, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "自油至电", "published_at": "2025-10-05T14:38:53.721000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/596337423/answer/2996243380"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "燃油车技术还是会更新的，但是可能不会在家用车领域，而是在货运、工程、军用车辆的领域。七座及以下小型乘用车的燃油车技术可能的确已经到头了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "在强大的基础设施的支持下，电动车的里程成本优势和动力优势太大，所以只要政府方面下定决心补足基础设施的短板，燃油车是没有机会赢过电动车的，这是原理性的差异，不是个人努力所能抗衡的。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 158}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "其实这背后有另一重要害，那就是世界总体和平日久，人口密度其实一直在持续升高，尤其是一些新兴国家，正在快速的步入新人口高峰。", "char_start": 159, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这其实是给建设电动车的相关基础设施打下了人口和市场基础。如果人口密度过低，建设大量充电桩就会得不偿失，优势就仍然会在燃油车一边。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "老实说，中国政府不是——或者不只是——看上了电动车生意，而且还看上了电动车背后的充电站、换电站、储能中心、高压输送网络、变电站、发电站……一连串的生意。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 362}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而且越是底层，越是竞争力强。", "char_start": 363, "char_end": 377}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而做到电动车这一级，就等于中国现在有能力提供从基础设施到终端应用的全产业一体化服务。", "char_start": 378, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这对那些人口已经爆炸、刚刚开始赚钱、基础设施还没有全面建设的新兴国家和比较成熟的发展中国家而言，是“实现四个现代化”的一条捷径。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 485}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这个市场之大，数以万亿计。更不提从能源基础设施到车辆应用全面使用中国标准，会对一个国家与中国的经济和政治关系有多么深刻的影响。", "char_start": 486, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这个道理既然中国政府看准了，中国政府肯用14亿人口的市场体量去下注孵化和培育，电动车就一定会赢过燃油车。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 602}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "某种意义上，这是历史的选择，而不全是技术问题。", "char_start": 603, "char_end": 626}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0503"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：上海车展一眼望去全是新能源车，现在还更新燃油车技术的车企是不是很少了？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“自油至电”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“燃油车技术还是会更新的，但是可能不会在家用车领域，而是在货运、工程、军用车辆的领域。七座及以下小型乘用车的燃油车技术可能的确已经到头了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "燃油车技术还是会更新的，但是可能不会在家用车领域，而是在货运、工程、军用车辆的领域。七座及以下小型乘用车的燃油车技术可能的确已经到头了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 68, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b116e6ef-6a65-5d8a-bf6d-93b30a4c4b8d", "source_ordinal": 547, "reading_ordinal": 3510, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "一丝", "published_at": "2025-10-05T15:45:17.870000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1957769861389325712/answer/1958195608146912082"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "走的就是钢丝，因为没人能在钢丝上超过我。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "钢丝要高，因为越高我的降落伞越好用。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 39}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0503"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：优秀企业家的风险观是什么样的？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002"], "summary": "围绕“一丝”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“走的就是钢丝，因为没人能在钢丝上超过我。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "走的就是钢丝，因为没人能在钢丝上超过我。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9a07d46a-6b4d-53cf-b9f0-44a0c3bb6605", "source_ordinal": 546, "reading_ordinal": 3511, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "馆阁", "published_at": "2025-10-06T06:04:49.593000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/465315745/answer/1958317135790085592"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很多人不清楚庞中华的字真正的由来，所以才会有错误的评判标准。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "现在的小朋友没有经历过那个年代，那时候印刷品只有两个来源——一个是铅活字拼板印刷，一个就是手写油印。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "前者是企事业单位的专门科室采购几套不同字号的铅活字来做，用来印制机构内部的文件、通知、公文等等。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "后者则是用铁尖硬笔在蜡纸上书写绘画，破坏蜡层，方便用油墨转印，是临时少量印刷文本的最普遍方法。", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "那时候老师出试卷，宣传科、工会出歌本子之类的临时印刷物大量的使用这个方法。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "庞中华的字其实根本不是给人用钢笔、圆珠笔拿来写信、写便条、写作业的，而是给老师们拿来出卷子、给工会写通知、给个人作者著书立说用的。所以才有如此“拘谨”“方正”的体态，在笔画中大量引入点、顿等衬线元素来防止印刷母版因为大量使用后轻微残缺带来的内容误读。这就跟Times New Roman字体和仿宋体这类“报宋”一样，但你试试手写仿宋体就知道了——这个效率要远低于庞字。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 401}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "庞中华楷书", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "1977年河南高考试卷", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "手写制图仿宋", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 429}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "为全国的宣传干事、老师、工会秘书们创设一款简便易用的公文字体——类似沈度、董其昌为邸报、奏折书写的“馆阁体”——才是庞字的基本立意。", "char_start": 431, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "文件写错字，那是要出大问题的，当然“灵动”“潇洒”不起来了。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 528}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "文件用字也没有笔走龙蛇、雄奇诡谲的诉求。", "char_start": 529, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "以这个诉求而言，庞字即使不说完美，至少也是优秀的答案。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 577}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "用来在当时的历史条件下全国推广也是完全合适的——开玩笑，文化人不学馆阁体，只会行书草书，准备只搞风花雪月、泼墨写意？不先学会写老百姓看得懂、认得出的规范字？", "char_start": 578, "char_end": 656}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这样的字体，你拿来写情书、写诗、写便条，写“快雪时晴”，当然就觉得束手束脚，不得快意。", "char_start": 657, "char_end": 700}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这不是庞中华的问题，而是你的问题。", "char_start": 701, "char_end": 718}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-026942515810a710d465b0b94df16348_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "https://pic1.zhimg.com/80/v2-026942515810a710d465b0b94df16348_1440w.webp?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG003", "src": "https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-c08cea03b6055299576c71aa61131623_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG004", "src": "https://pic1.zhimg.com/80/v2-c08cea03b6055299576c71aa61131623_1440w.webp?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG005", "src": "https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8ca6d68b92da043881d1ed0a3cad272f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG006", "src": "https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-8ca6d68b92da043881d1ed0a3cad272f_1440w.webp?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG007", "src": "https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9e68f7ab7fea69f2337c5ea7c5105b94_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG008", "src": "https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-9e68f7ab7fea69f2337c5ea7c5105b94_1440w.webp?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG009", "src": "https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8c2cc1a4b2860a1787963ae390d50ea9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG010", "src": "https://pic1.zhimg.com/80/v2-8c2cc1a4b2860a1787963ae390d50ea9_1440w.webp?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG011", "src": "https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a633890206931afd06d18306fbd817cd_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG012", "src": "https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-a633890206931afd06d18306fbd817cd_1440w.webp?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 35, "image": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0503"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么大家都不喜欢庞中华的字？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“馆阁”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很多人不清楚庞中华的字真正的由来，所以才会有错误的评判标准。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很多人不清楚庞中华的字真正的由来，所以才会有错误的评判标准。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "185475ec-e931-5aa9-8126-95b6c8824ce5", "source_ordinal": 545, "reading_ordinal": 3512, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "本末", "published_at": "2025-10-06T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/f7d409509caf11f0aa4052540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是个天大的误解。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这误解的根源在于很多人喜欢自媚，把自己不如人意的境况的原因总结为“嘴笨不会说话”“脑子笨不会来事”，把别人的成功总结为“没什么本事就是嘴甜”“会来事”。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这样一来，就会出现对“情商”这门“秘术”的崇拜。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "进而导致对缺乏这门秘术的焦虑。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "然而这从根上就是错的。", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "那些远比ta们“会来事”“会说话”的人为什么这么会来事、会说话？", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "无非是做得多、说得多，练出来的。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 190}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "为什么做得多、说得多？因为胆子大。", "char_start": 191, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "为什么胆子大？", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为在早期必然技术稀烂、必然一天到晚犯错的时候，发现犯错根本不可怕。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "怎么发现的“不可怕”？", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "是因为明白正直诚实、存心有爱的人，说错了话、造成了误会也不会有大事。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "甚至“先有误会，后来对方发现了是误会”，反而会加倍的造成更深的羁绊。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "是发现了只要你踩住几个关键的甚至是简单的原则，你其实可以“嘴笨”——你几乎可以毫无技巧的横冲直撞，最后的结果都会好。", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 392}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你甚至天天骂人，都有人说你刀子嘴豆腐心。", "char_start": 393, "char_end": 413}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因此，中国的传统教育根本不教“情商”，只教忠、孝、礼、义、廉、耻。", "char_start": 414, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你不需要技巧，只需要正心诚意，真诚的追求这些价值原则，你放心，你说话不周全，人自替你周全。你办事不妥帖，人自助你妥帖。", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而一旦你在早期建立了这样的安全感，又在实践中见证了赤诚之心的威力，你就会彻底的放松。", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 550}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你就自然而然的敢说、敢干、敢搭话、敢结交。", "char_start": 551, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "心底无私天地宽，胸中无欲气自刚。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 589}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "信了，你才敢了。", "char_start": 590, "char_end": 598}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "敢了，你才干了。", "char_start": 599, "char_end": 607}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "干了，你才熟了。", "char_start": 608, "char_end": 616}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "熟了，你才巧了。", "char_start": 617, "char_end": 625}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这是从信开始，自下而上生长出来的。到了外人赞叹这些精湛技艺时，这外人看到的已经是最后的一段。", "char_start": 626, "char_end": 672}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "而本末倒置的人却以为是这最后一段的“技巧性”的东西才是关键。", "char_start": 673, "char_end": 703}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "ta们误以为是人有了这个技巧，才有了这个胆量。", "char_start": 704, "char_end": 727}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "所以一天到晚在焦虑上哪里学这些技巧。", "char_start": 728, "char_end": 746}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "所以勉强学了一些技巧之后，胆战心惊的尝试运用，然而却又恰恰因为这份战战兢兢的鬼鬼祟祟，导致人发现ta其实是想用技巧操纵人心以自肥。", "char_start": 747, "char_end": 812}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "结果招来的是迎头痛击，只得到惨烈失败，毫无成功可言。既无成功可言，又哪里练得出胆量？", "char_start": 813, "char_end": 855}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "那份胆量根本就不是情商的结果，恰恰相反，情商才是那份胆量的结果。", "char_start": 856, "char_end": 888}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "你以为ta是因为有强大的平衡技巧才走过了那根十厘米宽的桥。", "char_start": 889, "char_end": 918}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你错了，ta是因为不怕，直接当做在散步走过去了。", "char_start": 919, "char_end": 943}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "因为如果把这桥画在地面上，你也一样可以走过去。", "char_start": 944, "char_end": 967}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你们的差距根本不在平衡技巧上，而在于你不信导致的恐惧上。", "char_start": 968, "char_end": 996}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你以为是技巧的东西，仅仅是无恐惧的人自自然然、毫无练习的天然表现。而恰恰是因为你目睹了ta那份自然从容，“肆无忌惮”，却似乎可以踏火而行，导致了你误以为那是什么惊天动地的技巧。", "char_start": 997, "char_end": 1085}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "这在那些著名的脱口秀演员身上有鲜明地体现——其实他们表演的真正关键不是什么发声技巧、表情管理，而是一份自信。自信“无论怎么作都肯定对”的自信。", "char_start": 1086, "char_end": 1157}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "是那份自信，让同样的话从ta们嘴里说出来就能感染人，而你照样背一遍却被嘘下台。", "char_start": 1158, "char_end": 1197}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "现在你明白要“提高子女的情商”应该怎么办了吗？", "char_start": 1198, "char_end": 1221}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你要不择手段的用一切的案例分析，历史研读，新闻讨论，让ta对诚实正直、友爱待人建立盲目的、不可动摇的信心。", "char_start": 1222, "char_end": 1275}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "就算你说错话、有误会，最后也一定可以解决。", "char_start": 1276, "char_end": 1297}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "要么顺利，要么曲折之后比直接顺利更牢固更好。", "char_start": 1298, "char_end": 1320}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "你根本不会失败，你只管开口，只管去做。", "char_start": 1321, "char_end": 1340}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "情商是你最用不着的东西，恰恰如此，你将来根本不会缺。", "char_start": 1341, "char_end": 1367}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "你怎么会缺少你用不着的东西？", "char_start": 1368, "char_end": 1382}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "不要本末倒置。", "char_start": 1384, "char_end": 1391}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "求其本，而斯末至矣。", "char_start": 1392, "char_end": 1402}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 50}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0503"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：父母感觉年轻一代情商不够，如何引导孩子提升沟通能力？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047"], "summary": "围绕“本末”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是个天大的误解。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是个天大的误解。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d9b20edf-578d-5ba0-a83e-88cf05e04092", "source_ordinal": 544, "reading_ordinal": 3513, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不拜来使", "published_at": "2025-10-07T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/f73f6e7a9d7811f0a3c152540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "做两难选择前，一定要先确认这真的是两难选择。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "大量的所谓两难选择、n选一，本质上只是自己被语言形式误导，误以为“题设不容挑战”的学校考试规矩放诸四海而皆准。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是一种学生的迷信。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "就以这个为例，你完全可以穿一身正装，然后拿个背包，装着第二、第三套衣服。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "到了现场一看气氛，看看人家的员工怎么穿的，然后找个理由去卫生间换一套。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你甚至可以拖个旅行箱，带个两三套百搭的，连补妆的家伙都带上。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "覆盖全部选项，直接消灭问题。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "看到没有？", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "谁说题设给你三选一就是三选一？凭什么是三？凭什么要选？", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你记住，自从你学校毕业，给你出题的就只有自然和历史。", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "别人出的题，你要先问自然和历史“这是不是你们的意思”。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "别人出的题其实只是谜面，自然和历史真正要出的题才是谜底。", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你猜别人出的题，是出题人给你奖励；你猜自然和历史出的题，是整个客观世界给你奖励。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你要学会透过“使者”和客观世界打交道。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 387}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "使者的主人才握着全部的牌，而不是使者。", "char_start": 388, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "不要拜错了山头。", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 416}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0503"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：面试时候穿什么最得体？正装、偏正式还是休闲装扮？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“不拜来使”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“做两难选择前，一定要先确认这真的是两难选择。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "做两难选择前，一定要先确认这真的是两难选择。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5ca35e55-fe25-519d-ac61-49046c6f7be5", "source_ordinal": 543, "reading_ordinal": 3514, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "色字头上一把刀", "published_at": "2025-10-08T05:13:19.446000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/626316490/answer/1958981361466582502"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "物化、异化到底是什么意思？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "意思是不再把对方看成人类，而是某种低人一等的事物，可以像对待签字、扳手、电吹风一样随便处理。", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这就是物化、异化的意思。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这跟对方担当什么职务、从事什么行业其实没什么必然关系，而是取决于你本人如何对待对方。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "对方跑快递的，送错了东西或者送错了地方，你可以按合同索赔，但是你不要说“要你有什么用”，不要仅仅因为对方犯了错而侮辱对方——因为人有犯错的天然权利，剥夺这个权利就是在拒绝拿人当人看。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "说得极端一点，对方是表演钢管舞的，也可以表示接受不了不愿服务，你可以要求退款甚至要求按合同额外赔偿，但你只能尊重和接受，因为你要尊重人选择劳动条件的权利。", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 286}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你如果尊重和接受了，那么即使对方是从事这个极其容易导致被物化的行业，对方也没有被你物化。", "char_start": 287, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "被物化，在自然层面上实际上是个人与个人之间发生的矛盾，是一种一对一的关系。", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 369}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "在社会层面上，“物化”要基于社会的立法来考量。举点例子，斯巴达的法律规定黑劳士不享受人权，只被视为大型家畜。张三打死一名黑劳士，ta需要负的责任仅仅是赔给主人钱财和罚款，就像现在你打死一条宠物犬一样，这就是社会层面的对人的物化。", "char_start": 370, "char_end": 484}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "又或者类似大英帝国对殖民地土著居民、美国对印第安土著、纳粹德国对犹太人和以色列对待巴勒斯坦人那样采取国家恐怖主义行为，这个也是对人的集体物化行为。", "char_start": 485, "char_end": 558}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "基于这个原理，卖淫之所以和女性被物化紧密联系在一起，是因为卖淫女性遭遇了非人待遇却往往会因为卖淫不合法、不合公共道德审美标准而无法需求救济、而寻求黑帮帮助则会欠下黑帮债务，导致情况恶化，因此使得“卖淫”和“女性被物化”有了强关联。", "char_start": 559, "char_end": 674}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "假设存在一个社会，性交易是合法的，而且都不会导致社会谴责，没有任何因性交易而剥夺女性尊严权利的机制存在，那么从学术意义上讲，这个社会里性交易和女性被物化这个议题就没什么关系。", "char_start": 675, "char_end": 762}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "但是不要小看“没有任何其他剥夺尊严权利的机制”这一条，这一条是极难被满足的。", "char_start": 763, "char_end": 801}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为在人类社会中存在一个底层的机制，不受人类法制和意识形态的约束，那就是某些职业会被认为自己有走投无路的人才会去做，但凡还有一个亲戚朋友，有最基本的接济，人都不会做这种工作，那么这种工作的从业者就会因为“被意识到缺少社会关系网的支持”而被人们不自觉的物化。", "char_start": 802, "char_end": 930}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这才是清洁工、快递员、保安、餐厅服务员等等职业——自然也包括色情行业的女性从业者们——难以摆脱物化对待的最普遍和最根本的机制。", "char_start": 931, "char_end": 994}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为这个机制是基于自然法，非人类所能消解而普遍的存在，所以“从事色情行业”才会和“女性物化”锁得这么紧。", "char_start": 995, "char_end": 1047}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "假设有一天色情行业不再被视为“走投无路的绝对证明”，那么这种关联是会被打破的。而从现在的世界潮流来看，这个恐怕还是一个日渐逼近的现实。", "char_start": 1048, "char_end": 1115}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "现在说你如果真诚的打算反对物化你要怎么办。", "char_start": 1116, "char_end": 1137}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "最关键的，不管别人怎么做、社会怎么规定、道德舆论怎么看，你自己本人不要存着任何“这个人不算人”的心——不管这个人什么样、从事什么职业、做了什么事、犯过什么样的罪，都一视同仁。", "char_start": 1138, "char_end": 1225}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你可以判东条英机绞刑，但不要用钢琴线去吊他。你可以对伊斯兰恐怖分子开枪，但不要在子弹上涂猪油。", "char_start": 1226, "char_end": 1273}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "遵从这个原则跟维护你自己的权益之间没有矛盾。", "char_start": 1274, "char_end": 1296}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "如果你一边自己抓住一切机会去凌辱、侵犯别人作为人的基本权利，一边主张“资本物化人”，不谈虚伪与否，至少在实践上这是没有意义的。", "char_start": 1297, "char_end": 1360}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "第二，在社会层面，要利用自己的影响力，反对和抑止一切不把人当人看的行为。例如你的学生这么干，你要告诫；子女这么干，要教育；员工这么干，要处置；供应商乃至客户这么做，那就要在利益分配安排上有所倾斜。", "char_start": 1361, "char_end": 1459}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你可以写信给人大代表反对你认为存在问题的立法。", "char_start": 1460, "char_end": 1483}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你还还可以自己去做人大代表和政协委员，自己做这个守夜人。", "char_start": 1484, "char_end": 1512}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "欲破山中贼，先破心中贼。", "char_start": 1514, "char_end": 1526}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0503"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：色情表演到底是不是物化女性？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“色字头上一把刀”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“物化、异化到底是什么意思？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "物化、异化到底是什么意思？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
